# SSAO samples behind the camera (reports/engine/2026-11-13-ssao-behind-camera): a face close to the camera lit by
# the sky alone, where the samples read off the screen drew dark patches of the mesh's facets, then the views the fix
# must leave as they are (a talk's distance, the game's camera, the market from afar and near the ground) and the
# other place of the same fault, a wall within a step of the camera (at a market house, inside the harbour house).
# Every view as shots of one camera: `-old` the samples behind the camera read as before 2026-11-13
# (`ssao study 1`), `-new` the game's, `-old2` the old again (the world does not stand still between shots: what
# differs between the two old ones is not the fix), and the same three as the occlusion alone, `-ao-old`, `-ao-new`,
# `-ao-old2` (`ssao study 3`, `2`: the frame's red channel, 1 open).
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1920x1080 BENCH_HOST=ryzen [OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<content with a head>] \
#     scripts/bench.sh ssao-behind-camera <out>
#   python reports/engine/2026-11-13-ssao-behind-camera/tools/pairs.py <out> [<sheets dir>]
# @timeout 900
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
blink off
view full
cam lift off
set time 12 0
# the hero's facing of npc-head-look.bench (placed in front of Xardas first): at the market the noon sun is then
# above and behind him, the face in its own shade
watch nearest
freeze nearest
wait 500
place 110 0
wait 800
watch player
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
watch player
wait 5000
